%% Durable servicing case — execution sequence (saga + compensation + human-in-the-loop)
%% Render at https://mermaid.live or import into Excalidraw (Mermaid to Excalidraw)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Console
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant WF as ServicingCaseWorkflow (Temporal)
    participant SVC as Services (card · ledger · fulfillment)

    UI->>API: POST /cases/start {intent, params}
    API->>WF: start workflow (plan, requires_approval)

    alt over policy
        WF-->>UI: query status = awaiting_approval
        UI->>API: POST /cases/{id}/decision (approve)
        API->>WF: signal submit_decision(true)
    end

    loop each saga step
        WF->>API: do_action → POST /internal/action/{action}
        API->>SVC: mutate state + write audit entry
        SVC-->>WF: ok
    end

    alt a step fails after retries
        WF->>API: compensate completed steps in reverse
        Note over WF,SVC: refund fee → unblock card → rolled_back
    end

    WF-->>UI: final status (resolved | rolled_back | denied | expired)
